      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, sorry, what do you mean by \"goblin twist\" or \"magic\"? I just need the actual accounting steps for my report. Can you just give me the standard depreciation formula and the final annual expense amount without the metaphors? I need to keep this professional for my manager.",
